.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH sqop-certify-userid 1 "February 2025" "sqop 0.38.0" 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
sqop\-certify\-userid \- Certify OpenPGP Certificate User IDs
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBsqop certify\-userid\fR [\fB\-\-debug\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-armor\fR] <\fB\-\-userid\fR> [\fB\-\-with\-key\-password\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-require\-self\-sig\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIKEYS\fR] 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Certify OpenPGP Certificate User IDs
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-\-debug\fR
Emit verbose output for debugging
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-armor\fR
Don\*(Aqt ASCII\-armor output
.TP
\fB\-\-userid\fR \fI<USERID>\fR
Certify the specified user IDs
.TP
\fB\-\-with\-key\-password\fR \fI<WITH_KEY_PASSWORD>\fR
Unlock the keys with these passwords
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-require\-self\-sig\fR
Don\*(Aqt require self\-signatures on the user IDs to be certified
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIKEYS\fR]
Create certifications using these keys
